00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:19.880
de recibos

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:20.260
y preparan

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:20.900
entradas de gastos

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:21.420
y preparan

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:22.140
entradas de gastos

