00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:57.660
de Microsoft.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:17:59.380
Piénselo como la recepción

00:17:59.380 --> 00:17:59.920
que verifica

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:00.760
